   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Give Children a Safer and Happier Childhood</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ludoteca Minga is a place located in Concon, a city in the Valparaiso region, Chile. Here the community can participate in free environmental workshops such as agriculture, community edible gardens, and more. Our program creates spaces that promote joint and collaborative learning, where children, youth an even older adults participate. We seek to promote community learning, providing them with the tools, skills and values they need to develop a society concerned about the environment.</narrative>
  </description>
